# NEXORA — project folder.
# The Next.js app (kads-labs-app) is the live NEXORA site; kads-labs-website
# holds the original static-site template (source kept for reference).

# heavy template media — available in the upstream template repo if ever needed:
# https://github.com/gireeshkumarreddy/Teseract-creative-studious
*.mp4
kads-labs-website/public/assets/media/
kads-labs-website/dist/

# installed tool packages (reinstall with: cd _tools && npm install)
node_modules/

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# stray tool logs at the project root (QA scripts write their logs in the session scratchpad)
/*.log
